Fe  0.0    Fe.rel-pbe-kjpaw.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS alat
Fe  0.0000000   0.00000000   0.0
K_POINTS tpiba_b
3
H1  40
gG  40
0.0 0.0 1.0 1
